  "Description":      "Natural Language Understanding: receives Input Text (PortNumber 1) or Recognised Text (PortNumber 2) - either may be absent - and produces the Text Descriptors Object (MMC-TDO) carrying the Basic Text Descriptors, a Refined Text, and the Text Personal Status (MMC-TPS: a value for each Personal Status Factor). A first-pass tagger fills POS and NE taggings (dependency and SRL left null, as the spec permits). Text ports accept both OSD-BTO and OSD-TXO.",

